1
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:10,611
(Sanada) I want to be an idol with everyone.

2
00:00:13,647 --> 00:00:18,018
(sob)

3
00:00:34,034 --> 00:00:38,005
“I want to be an idol with everyone.”

4
00:00:39,173 --> 00:00:41,175
Thank you for your hard work

5
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:46,279
Were you watching it again?

6
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:50,783
After all, it would be a waste to quit like this.

7
00:00:50,784 --> 00:00:54,654
Look for an office where you can take on the challenge even now.

8
00:00:54,655 --> 00:00:58,291
Why don't you just continue being an idol, Sanada-kun?

9
00:00:58,292 --> 00:01:00,293
There are so many people supporting me...

10
00:01:00,294 --> 00:01:04,531
I don't like it, then.

11
00:01:07,234 --> 00:01:09,236
I…

12
00:01:11,438 --> 00:01:14,441
It's no good unless you're an eternal boy.

13
00:01:15,943 --> 00:01:18,078
I see...

14
00:01:42,669 --> 00:01:49,343
I guess as you get older you get used to giving up.

15
00:01:51,478 --> 00:01:59,386
Isn't life a series of things that can't be helped?

16
00:02:01,154 --> 00:02:07,761
That's why I gradually become addicted to it.

17
00:02:11,565 --> 00:02:16,403
(Yamanaka) Even you said, "It can't be helped."

18
00:02:19,373 --> 00:02:21,375
yes

19
00:02:26,113 --> 00:02:28,115
but…

20
00:02:33,187 --> 00:02:36,623
Eternal Boy taught me this, right?

21
00:02:41,395 --> 00:02:55,208
♬～

22
00:02:55,209 --> 00:02:57,211
(2 people) I…

23
00:03:00,848 --> 00:03:04,917
Say it first

24
00:03:04,918 --> 00:03:09,289
Mr. Yamanaka, please say it first.

25
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:14,161
still…

26
00:03:20,467 --> 00:03:22,468
I don't want to give up

27
00:03:22,469 --> 00:03:31,544
♬～

28
00:03:31,545 --> 00:03:36,783
I was thinking the same thing too

29
00:03:39,019 --> 00:03:41,021
Hehehehe

30
00:03:55,469 --> 00:04:00,039
(Imagawa) It's late. We're both tired of waiting. (Asai)

31
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:03,177
Didn't everyone leave?

32
00:04:05,112 --> 00:04:11,717
(Ishida) It can't be helped that we break up. We're not young enough to complain.

33
00:04:11,718 --> 00:04:21,527
But it's okay to have a little struggle at the end.

34
00:04:21,528 --> 00:04:24,463
Me too...

35
00:04:24,464 --> 00:04:27,733
But the venue... (Kakizaki) I've already figured it out.

36
00:04:27,734 --> 00:04:32,338
I said I could pay later because it would be offset against sales.

37
00:04:32,339 --> 00:04:34,407
Let's do it live

38
00:04:34,408 --> 00:04:38,545
I want everyone to sing "Again" at the end.

39
00:04:40,247 --> 00:04:43,250
Yes ah

40
00:04:45,919 --> 00:04:52,291
♬Uuuuuuuuuuuuuu

41
00:04:52,292 --> 00:05:00,399
♬～

42
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:08,274
♬The words “See you” make me feel lonely.

43
00:05:08,275 --> 00:05:16,516
♬(Asai) For some reason, I feel so loved by ordinary moments.

44
00:05:16,517 --> 00:05:20,386
♬Me in the middle of a long road

45
00:05:20,387 --> 00:05:24,524
♬(Kakizaki) It was you who found me

46
00:05:24,525 --> 00:05:28,227
♬(Imagawa) Stop and listen to this voice

47
00:05:28,228 --> 00:05:30,596
♬(Ishida) Thank you for giving it to me.

48
00:05:30,597 --> 00:05:34,800
♬(All) Again (Hey) Again (Hey) Again (Hey)

49
00:05:34,801 --> 00:05:38,571
♬What I want to tell you

50
00:05:38,572 --> 00:05:42,742
♬Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah)

51
00:05:42,743 --> 00:05:46,779
♬Today is forever

52
00:05:46,780 --> 00:05:50,917
♬Again (Hey) Again (Hey) Again (Hey)

53
00:05:50,918 --> 00:05:54,587
♬We'll meet again someday

54
00:05:54,588 --> 00:05:58,891
♬Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah)

55
00:05:58,892 --> 00:06:04,263
♬ Repeat this voice

56
00:06:04,264 --> 00:06:12,238
♬It's not like you're only worrying about the future you can't see.

57
00:06:12,239 --> 00:06:20,546
♬No matter what happens, for some reason I think it's okay

58
00:06:20,547 --> 00:06:24,250
♬I can hear your voice no matter where I am

59
00:06:24,251 --> 00:06:28,387
♬No matter how far away the place is

60
00:06:28,388 --> 00:06:32,325
♬ Being able to be by my side like this now

61
00:06:32,326 --> 00:06:34,660
♬I think it's a miracle

62
00:06:34,661 --> 00:06:38,865
♬(Everyone) Again (Hey) Again (Hey) Again (Hey)

63
00:06:38,866 --> 00:06:42,535
♬The days I spent with you

64
00:06:42,536 --> 00:06:46,706
♬Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah)

65
00:06:46,707 --> 00:06:50,643
♬It shines more than anything

66
00:06:50,644 --> 00:06:54,780
♬Again (Hey) Again (Hey) Again (Hey)

67
00:06:54,781 --> 00:06:58,618
♬Your existence

68
00:06:58,619 --> 00:07:02,955
♬Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah)

69
00:07:02,956 --> 00:07:08,327
♬Keep supporting me

70
00:07:08,328 --> 00:07:15,034
♬(Kakizaki/Ishida) The time I thought “someday” has come

71
00:07:15,035 --> 00:07:18,804
♬I don't need tears

72
00:07:18,805 --> 00:07:24,544
♬(Yamanaka/Imagawa) Show me your smile

73
00:07:24,545 --> 00:07:28,848
♬(Everyone) Again (Hey) Again (Hey) Again (Hey)

74
00:07:28,849 --> 00:07:32,718
♬What I want to tell you

75
00:07:32,719 --> 00:07:36,756
♬Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah)

76
00:07:36,757 --> 00:07:40,960
♬Today is forever

77
00:07:40,961 --> 00:07:44,730
♬Again (Hey) Again (Hey) Again (Hey)

78
00:07:44,731 --> 00:07:48,501
♬We'll meet again someday

79
00:07:48,502 --> 00:07:52,839
♬Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah) Again (Yeah)

80
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:58,044
♬ Repeat this voice

81
00:07:58,045 --> 00:08:08,020
♬～

82
00:08:08,021 --> 00:08:17,931
(cheers)

83
00:08:19,566 --> 00:08:27,373
Eternal Boy will forever be in everyone's heart.

84
00:08:27,374 --> 00:08:31,611
Thank you everyone

85
00:08:31,612 --> 00:08:34,514
(Audience) Thank you!

86
00:08:34,515 --> 00:09:00,339
♬～

87
00:09:00,340 --> 00:09:06,579
≪For 35 years, I have lived a dull and normal life≫

88
00:09:06,580 --> 00:09:08,581
≪That's fine≫

89
00:09:08,582 --> 00:09:10,583
≪That's good≫

90
00:09:10,584 --> 00:09:12,686
≪While saying that≫

91
00:09:16,089 --> 00:09:18,258
≪But...≫

92
00:09:36,844 --> 00:09:40,414
everyone key

93
00:09:49,690 --> 00:09:51,692
Disbanding...

94
00:09:54,027 --> 00:09:56,663
I don't think they'll break up

95
00:10:00,434 --> 00:10:06,606
Eternal Shonen will not disband and will be on hiatus.

96
00:10:06,607 --> 00:10:09,776
that's why…

97
00:10:13,647 --> 00:10:17,084
Don't lose your key

98
00:10:19,653 --> 00:10:21,889
I'll be using it again soon

99
00:10:28,862 --> 00:10:30,864
Hehehe

100
00:10:31,999 --> 00:10:34,001
Let's go

101
00:10:36,103 --> 00:10:38,104
yes

102
00:10:38,105 --> 00:11:00,993
♬～

103
00:11:00,994 --> 00:11:03,829
“Eikyu Shonen”?

104
00:11:03,830 --> 00:11:08,434
Nikolai Asakura: Besides cooking, he also takes care of us.

105
00:11:08,435 --> 00:11:13,840
I want to see more scenery with this member.

106
00:11:13,841 --> 00:11:16,943
(Fukuko) Eternal boy, start!

107
00:11:16,944 --> 00:11:19,947
But you can't do it, right? I hope you get better from now on.

108
00:11:21,181 --> 00:11:23,183
(Imagawa) Sanayan...

109
00:11:27,087 --> 00:11:30,790
(Ren) Let's have a comedy competition, shall we? Comedy competition?

110
00:11:30,791 --> 00:11:32,793
yes cheese

111
00:11:35,195 --> 00:11:37,196
Did you see it?

112
00:11:37,197 --> 00:11:39,866
(Together) Eternal youth!

113
00:11:39,867 --> 00:11:43,102
(Manda) It leads to a come-from-behind home run.

114
00:11:43,103 --> 00:11:45,105
｟Hahahaha｠

115
00:11:46,340 --> 00:11:48,341
(cheers)

116
00:11:48,342 --> 00:11:51,144
Was Eternal Boy really that easy?

117
00:11:54,314 --> 00:11:56,482
I want to be an idol with everyone

118
00:11:56,483 --> 00:12:04,992
♬～
